# Fix errors as you find them (InPmnt)

When testing, reviewing, or shipping, **fix every clear defect in the same turn** — do not only report it and ask whether to fix.

Examples: encoding/mojibake, broken links, missing version text, 500s you caused, UI copy errors, auth/logout gaps.

Ship the fix (bump patch, build, release, handoff) unless the user explicitly said to stop.
